h Nuvolari and Brivio not far behind; Etancelin, eighth, has a misfiring engine.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":2,"text":"Caracciola drove the second lap in 2m05, an average speed of 109,152 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":7,"text":"After seven laps the French driver Rey retired in his old 2300 Bugatti with a broken cylinder.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":8,"text":"On lap eight Caracciola made another new lap record in 2m04, an average of 110.032 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":9,"text":"Villapadierna pits; Hell\u00e9-Nice passes Zehender.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":11,"text":"Zehender retakes the place from Hell\u00e9-Nice. Etancelin, after several stops for his misfire, retires.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":14,"text":"Fagioli closes on Caracciola. Garc\u00eda stops his Bugatti at the pits but rejoins.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"Up to lap 20 the positions had changed little but on that lap Zehender was able to overhaul Soffietti and gained fifth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":21,"text":"After lap 21 the Spaniard Villapadierna retired with a broken crankshaft bearing","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":23,"text":"At the end of lap 23 Fagioli was the first to appear at the finish line and was applauded because this change gave the boring race new life.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":23,"text":"Caracciola is second, Nuvolari 30 seconds behind and Brivio 40.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":24,"text":"On lap 24 Nuvolari stopped to take on fuel when his team mate Brivio passed him while he was in the pits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":25,"text":"The two Mercedes, running in tandem, lap Nuvolari as he leaves the pits.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":30,"text":"After lap 30, Fagioli led in 1h02m23s at 109.374 km/h race average, followed by Caracciola, Brivio, Nuvolari, Zehender, Soffietti, Hell\u00e9-Nice and Garcia.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"Fagioli finished 40 laps in a time of 1h23m06s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":42,"text":"Caracciola passes Fagioli for the lead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":43,"text":"While rounding a turn his Alfa Romeo brushed a sand bag barrier which resulted in a near spin, but he was able to avoid a serious incident.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":43,"text":"Garc\u00eda retires his Bugatti after many laps in the pits.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":47,"text":"Fagioli retakes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"After lap 50, Fagioli led at 109.324 km/h race average, followed by Caracciola with Brivio still in third place, ahead of Nuvolari, Zehender, Soffietti and Hell\u00e9-Nice.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":55,"text":"Brivio refuels and must come back for plugs; Nuvolari takes third.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":55,"text":"On lap 55 Caracciola and Fagioli stopped to refuel. While Caracciola took a whole minute, Fagioli left after just 22 seconds which gave him a good lead over his team mate.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"After 60 laps Fagioli's time is 2h05m39s, Caracciola second, Nuvolari third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":61,"text":"Hell\u00e9-Nice retires with a broken differential, nine laps down.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":67,"text":"With the Mercedes easing off, Nuvolari passes Fagioli to unlap himself.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":70,"text":"Fagioli wins in 2h27m38s from Caracciola, Nuvolari, Brivio, Zehender and Soffietti.","q":false,"c":0}]}